      "type": "text",
      "text": "# What was I doing?\n\n> **Session Continuity Canvas (/continuity)**\n\nUse this board after a session pause or crash to recover active context.\n\n- [[_moc/HOME|Return Home]]\n- [[_meta/trust-policy|Trust Policy]]",
      "x": -200,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260
    },
    {
      "id": "node-2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Active Session State\n\n- **Status:** Active / Ready\n- **Current Task:** Reviewing session continuity and recovery points\n- **Last Checkpoint:** `~/.starlight/c/active_session.json`\n- **Recovery Runbook:** See `docs/continuity.md`",
      "x": 240,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260
    },
    {
      "id": "node-3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Two-Vault Recovery Actions\n\n1. Confirm trust policy in `_meta/trust-policy.md` is approved (`approved: true`).\n2. Open `~/.starlight/c` cache to view active checkpoint state.\n3. Restore last backup from `~/.starlight/c_backups/` if session crashed.\n4. Resume work seamlessly without opening a terminal.",
      "x": -200,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 840,
      "height": 220
    }
  ],
